      "writtenOn": "2026-08-14T05:39:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The current API does not clearly distinguish between a successful LUT match and a fallback result, since unmatched events also return a valid AFIDInfo.\n\nRecommendation: Either return std::nullopt for unmatched events, or include an explicit lookup status in the result (e.g. Matched, MissingKey, PatternMismatch, MessageNotFound). This preserves lookup outcome information, avoids ambiguity between valid and fallback results, and provides better diagnostics for consumers.",
      "revId": "90b9ed5503753148128865c1f04d2806a8f0d56a",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
